Z||000008||loafer87gt||01-11-2001||07:39 PM||||The first time my headlight doors flew open it scared the beejeekers out of me! I was taking a buddy out for a blast in my ride and when we hit about 110 mph the doors flew open! It was kinda creepy because my steering got very light on the front of the car. One of my buddies who used to own a 2M4 CLAIMS that when he turned on his headlights going flat out (whats that, around 70 for a duke  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) that his front wheels would lift of the ground.||||reg||1
